# The upstream GPUStack release this fork is merged up to.
#
# Single source of truth for three things that MUST stay in lockstep:
#   1. the merge base of this repo   (git merge-base HEAD <UPSTREAM_BASE> == <UPSTREAM_BASE>)
#   2. BASE_IMAGE in pack/Dockerfile.acr and the pack-acr-overlay workflow input
#   3. hack/check-overlay-list.sh's reference point
#
# Bump procedure: merge the new upstream tag, re-run hack/check-overlay-list.sh,
# re-sync the ACR base image, then update this file and the two BASE_IMAGE
# defaults in the same commit.
#
#   SRC=quay.io/gpustack/gpustack:v2.2.3 ./hack/sync-image-to-acr.sh v2.2.3
UPSTREAM_BASE=v2.2.3
